  "goodToKnow": "Das Gestein is rock as a material: hartes, vulkanisches Gestein, Sedimentgestein. Der Stein is a single stone, and der Fels a large rock or cliff. Ge- often makes collective nouns: das Gebirge (mountain range, from Berg), das Gewässer (waters), das Gebüsch (bushes). The Elbsandsteingebirge near Dresden has dramatic sandstone formations. Plural: die Gesteine."
